.TH marksman 1 "FUZIX System Utilities" "FUZIX"
.SH NAME
marksman \- show a Markdown document on the screen
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marksman
.I file
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B marksman
formats a Markdown file for the terminal: headings, bold and italic,
bulleted and numbered lists, named lists, tables, block quotes and
fenced code, laid out to the width of the screen.
.PP
It is a viewer, not a search path.  Give it the name of a file.
.SH NOTES
This is a second and separate documentation system from
.BR man (1).
.B man
reads nroff pages out of
.BR /usr/man ;
.B marksman
reads Markdown out of wherever you point it.  The manual pages on this
machine are the
.B man
kind.
.PP
Inline code marked with backticks is only handled as a whole block, not
in the middle of a line.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1),
.BR more (1)
